{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321307001:1":{"text":"嬉しいねぇ、まだこんなに生き生きとしてるよ！見ときな、この子たちはシロクマ温泉旅館をさらに繁盛させる。ウチの予感はよく当たるんだ。","source_cn":"这些小家伙放到温泉里还是活蹦乱跳的，看着让人高兴！我有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEDE125D8638EBCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321307002:1":{"text":"よかった。今のところ、みんな新しい環境に適応できてるみたいですね！","source_cn":"是啊，它们暂时都没出现不适应环境的情况，真是件好事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD30B97F9318A14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321307003:1":{"text":"でも、どの種がより温泉での飼育に適しているかは、もう少し様子を見たほうがいいと思います。","source_cn":"不过，具体哪几种才更适合在温泉中饲养，恐怕得观察一阵子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6609F5D3203821F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321307004:1":{"text":"それなら心配いらないべ。ウチがしっかり観察を続けるつもりだからね。","source_cn":"放心吧，亲爱的。我本来就打算留在这里观察它们的，不用担...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x636EC086815B4B54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321307005:1":{"text":"でも、そうなると、スノーシダー町には行けなくなっちゃうべ……","source_cn":"不过这样一来，我就抽不出时间去雪松镇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6A91661B7B378BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_inde